{"suttaId":"tha-ap267","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[8461,8476],"vripara":"18"},"segments":{"tha-ap267:0.3":"Biḷālidāyakattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap267:1.1":"“Himavantassāvidūre, romaso nāma pabbato;","tha-ap267:1.3":"Tamhi pabbatapādamhi, samaṇo bhāvitindriyo.","tha-ap267:2.1":"“Biḷāliyo gahetvāna, samaṇassa adāsahaṃ;","tha-ap267:2.3":"Anumodi mahāvīro, sayambhū aparājito.","tha-ap267:3.1":"“Biḷālī te mama dinnā, vippasannena cetasā;","tha-ap267:3.3":"Bhave nibbattamānamhi, phalaṃ nibbattataṃ tava.","tha-ap267:4.1":"“Catunnavutito kappe, yaṃ biḷālimadāsahaṃ;","tha-ap267:4.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, biḷāliyā idaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap267:5.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap267:6.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā biḷālidāyako thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap267:7.1":"Biḷālidāyakattherassāpadānaṃ pañcamaṃ."},"attha":{"book":"Ap-a","bookName":"Apadāna-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0510a.att","from":3226,"to":3226,"paras":[{"para":3226,"vripara":"18-19","refs":["tha-ap267:1"],"lines":["18-19. Pañcamāpadāne <b>himavantassāvidūre</b>ti himavantassa āsanne.","<b>Romaso nāma pabbato</b>ti rukkhalatāgumbābhāvā kevalaṃ dabbatiṇādisañchannattā romaso nāma pabbato ahosi.","<b>Tamhi pabbatapādamhī</b>ti tasmiṃ pabbatapariyante.","<b>Samaṇo bhāvitindriyo</b>ti samitapāpo vūpasantakileso samaṇo vaḍḍhitaindriyo, rakkhitacakkhundriyādiindriyoti attho.","Atha vā vaḍḍhitaindriyo vaḍḍhitasaddhindriyādiindriyoti attho.","Tassa samaṇassa ahaṃ biḷāliāluve gahetvā adāsinti attho."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap267:1"],["tha-ap267:1"],["tha-ap267:1"],["tha-ap267:1"],["tha-ap267:1"],["tha-ap267:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[["tha-ap267:1.1","himavantassāvidūre",0,0],["tha-ap267:1.1","romaso nāma pabbato",0,1],["tha-ap267:1.3","tamhi pabbatapādamhī",0,2],["tha-ap267:1.3","samaṇo bhāvitindriyo",0,3]]},"tika":null,"tika2":null}
